## Source material

Techniques and ideas are adapted from Sean Eron Anderson's collection:

  https://graphics.stanford.edu/~seander/bithacks.html

Individually, the original code snippets are in the public domain
(unless otherwise noted on that page). The aggregate collection and
descriptions are © 1997-2005 Sean Eron Anderson.

This repository is an independent C++23 tutorial rewrite with original
Chinese explanations. It is not an official product of Stanford University
or the original author.
